Oakiss
------

An oasis[0] fork, initially it was made to be used with kiss, but ive since
removed it.

Whats different now you ask?
Well, not much now really.
With the removal of kiss, the only few things left is the packages.
Mainly rcinit[1] replaces sinit, and rcsm[2] replaces perp.
Theres also a few differences in the number of packages.
I opted not to get all packages from upstream, as I didnt need all of them,
and ive packaged a few on my own aswell.



[0] https://github.com/oasislinux/oasis
[1] https://srcdump/hovercats/rcinit
[2] https://srcdump/hovercats/rcsm